abstract: Nine independently published books in Russian, English, Spanish, Japanese and Korean. The corpus
  preserves 45 published source-edition DOIs, attribution, AI-role disclosure and author contact for reading,
  retrieval, research and AI reuse with attribution. Book text is CC BY 4.0; helper and companion code
  has its separately stated MIT licence. Third-party materials retain their rights. This record identifies
  the corpus collection and does not assert a new collection DOI or scientific peer review.
